# Loaded by `vite build` in mode "production" (`bun run build`, `bun run build:prod`; `deploy:dev` uses .env.staging). Public values only.
# Turnstile site key of the production widget (clearance level "managed", hostname cavarabd.com). Blank turns the
# browser side off; the server then refuses orders on any host but localhost, so set this before the secret goes live.
VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=
